<title>UK: GMAC to launch $1.0 billion five-year global bond.</title>
<headline>GMAC to launch $1.0 billion five-year global bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors Acceptance Corp will launch a $1.0 billion five-year global bond later this week, J.P. Morgan said Tuesday as joint lead manager.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch will also be joint lead manager.  </p>
<p>GMAC, rated A3/A-, last issued an international dollar bond last November with a $200 million four-year deal at a spread of 32 basis points over U.S. Treasuries.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
